ch Future research 200 detailed Research Gates and 33 Phoenix Answer Embryos Evidence 30 DOI records plus mother-lineage and fair classical comparators Edition scale 782 pages and approximately 120,338 English words Scientific Boundary Validation is limited to sealed microfluidics, synthetic standards, organ-chip phantoms and lawfully authorized ex vivo materials. The monograph does not authorize implantation, autonomous diagnosis, treatment or patient-facing operation. Quantum sensing is a candidate measurement channel and receives no presumption of superiority. Recommended Citation 33 and STARLI Research Works. Adaptive Microrobotic Sampling and Quantum Sensing Closed Loops at the Limit. Institute XXIX, Fission 01, Version 1.0, 2026. Keywords adaptive sampling; microrobotics; quantum sensing; expected information gain; Bayesian experimental design; mechanism discrimination; microfluidics; uncertainty governance; safe exploration; abstention; human veto; Research Gates", "publication_year": 2026, "cited_by_count": 0, "abstract_inverted_index": {"Adaptive": [0, 258], "Microrobotic": [1, 259], "Sampling": [2, 76, 260], "and": [3, 32, 37, 55, 70, 87, 91, 101, 107, 166, 184, 195, 203, 220, 245, 254, 261], "Quantum": [4, 115, 238, 262], "Sensing": [5, 263], "Closed": [6, 264], "Loops": [7, 265], "at": [8, 136, 266], "the": [9, 34, 267], "Limit": [10], "STARLI": [11, 255], "Research": [12, 152, 182, 256, 298], "Works": [13], "Institute": [14, 269], "XXIX": [15], "Fission": [16, 271], "01": [17], "English": [18, 206], "Description": [19], "This": [20], "high-density": [21], "research": [22, 156, 175, 179], "monograph": [23, 157, 227], "asks": [24], "whether": [25], "a": [26, 43, 132, 241], "microrobot": [27], "can": [28], "measure,": [29], "update": [30], "uncertainty": [31, 150, 291], "select": [33], "next": [35], "safest": [36], "most": [38], "discriminating": [39], "sampling": [40, 145], "action": [41], "within": [42], "fixed": [44], "budget.": [45], "It": [46], "repla